    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d920">

                <pb facs="0744" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/7652</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Consul Letcher </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 6, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Recent press despatches state American employees National Mines and Smelter
                    Company, Magistral, Durango, disarmed, and Magistral looted.</p>
                <p>Endeavor ascertain whether report correct. If Americans at Magistral in personal
                    danger, or such danger threatened, advise them to leave that place.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
